{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：14:53 2026-11-25 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:53 2026-11-25 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:53 2026-11-25 HKT</p><img alt=\"啟德天璽．海招標連沽2伙 4房雙套逾7527萬售\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/18cc8d7d730462fdb5d16fddbee828e4/2026-11/KF_Christine_66_.png\"/><p>新地旗下的啟德豪宅項目天璽．海，今日（25日）連錄兩宗招標成交，其中第1座18樓B室，面積1,408方呎，4房雙套間隔，連1個車位，成交價7,527.48萬元，成交呎價53,462元。</p><p>另一伙為第8座12樓B室，面積1,157方呎，4房1套間隔，成交價4,436.9萬元，成交呎價38,348元。兩伙合共套現近1.2億元。項目以現樓推售以來，累售53伙，套現逾36億元。<br/> </p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-25T07:03:59.046421+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":268,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-25T06:53:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T07:17:22.127791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-25T06:57:20.563640+00:00","content_hash":"077b77c3fdce7698688a62098691106588e3f746f4f12fb252eae79692019bf2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}